  "how": "use_figma, the per-page JS in scripts/design/figma_inventory.py's docstring (the second block for 06 · Storyboards). One call per page: the Plugin API allows one page switch per call.",
  "scope": "Frame and component NAMES, plus variant values for the App / * sets, for 01 · Foundations, 02 · Components, 03 · App and 04 · Site (vinc.canon.design-system-operations §2). For 06 · Storyboards, each journey row with its step frame names. Boards inside sections are listed as page frames. 00 · Cover, 05 · Email and 90 · Archive carry nothing the gate counts.",
  "note": "Machine dump. Never patch it by hand: re-run the dump. A hand-patched inventory makes the gate agree with a file instead of with Figma.",
  "site_screens_note": "04 · Site boards are html-to-design captures (capture_site_figma.mjs) named Site · <Route>[ · <state>] / dark; children are not recorded.",
  "app_boards_note": "03 · App boards are html-to-design captures (capture_app_figma.mjs) named App · <Surface>[ · <state>] / <theme>; children are not recorded.",
  "refreshed": "2026-10-24: whole file restructured to eight pages; 03 and 04 recaptured from the running app and the live site. 2026-10-30: 06 · Storyboards added (journeys); the other four pages were not re-dumped. 2026-11-04: all five pages re-dumped after 03 and 04 were recaptured (app 72 states, site 148 boards); old boards moved to 90 · Archive. Later on 2026-11-04: 02 · Components re-dumped after the retired sets and variants moved to 90 · Archive (Lens panel 2D · Timeline · Weave, App / PackCard, the old tab Settings sheet and the standalone Tools · Import · GRAPH.md sheets) and Overlay / Settings was rebuilt from the settings captures. Later again on 2026-11-04: 02 · Components and 03 · App re-dumped after the Lens panel 3D variants were rebuilt from captures, Overlay / Settings gained Tab=General and 03 gained the settings-general board; 04 · Site frame names were read again and match."
